---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
const title = `Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`;
const description = `How Apna Senior Concierge collects, uses and protects the information you share when you contact us.`;
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <main id="main" class="legal">
    <p style="margin:0 0 calc(1.2*var(--leading))"><a href="/">← Back to Apna Senior Concierge</a></p>

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated {site.lastUpdated}</p>

    <p class="lead">Families trust us with details about their parents. We collect only what we need to call you back and arrange visits, we never sell it, and we ask you not to put medical details on this website.</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Apna Senior Concierge (“Apna,” “we,” “us”) is a non-medical companion and concierge service in the {site.region}, run by {site.founder}. You can reach us at {site.emailLive ? <><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></> : <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>}.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you fill in the “Book a free call” form, you choose what to share. That can include who the support is for and their age, the city, how they get around, the days and hours you have in mind, what help you need most, whether you have used a service like this before, your name and phone number, an optional email address, the best time and language for a call, and how you heard about us.</p>
    <p>Please do <strong>not</strong> put medical details, diagnoses or health history in the form. Save those for the phone call.</p>
    <p>If you become a client, we also keep what we need to run your service: your sign-in email, a profile for your parent, visit requests, summaries of our visits, and invoices.</p>
    <p>This site is for adult family members and caregivers. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 18.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To call or email you back and talk through how we can help.</li>
      <li>To plan a first visit and, if you go ahead, a regular weekly schedule.</li>
      <li>To improve how we explain and run the service.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We use your information only for these reasons. We do not use it for unrelated marketing without your consent, and we never sell or rent it.</p>

    <h2>Where your information goes</h2>
    <p>When you send the booking form, your answers are saved in a secured database run by our hosting provider. Once email alerts are switched on, a short notice also goes to our inbox through an email service. We receive only what you chose to type, and nothing on the form is sent to advertisers.</p>
    <p>If you pay online, the payment is handled by Stripe. We do not see or store your full card number.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>We keep tracking to a minimum. We run no advertising trackers. If we turn on website analytics, we will use a privacy-friendly, cookieless tool that counts overall visits and does not build a profile of you or follow you to other websites. Your browser may store a small note that you have seen our cookie notice. If you sign in to the family portal, a sign-in cookie keeps you logged in until you sign out.</p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>We share your information with the people at Apna who are arranging your family’s visits, and with the providers that keep the website and our email running, such as our hosting, database, email and payment providers. We may share information if the law requires it. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep inquiry details for as long as we need them to follow up. If you become a client, we keep your information while we serve your family and for as long afterward as our records and legal duties require. You can ask us to delete your information at any time.</p>

    <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the information you have given us, or ask us to stop contacting you. {site.emailLive ? <>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></> : <>Call or text <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></>} and we will take care of it. California residents have additional rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA), including the right to know, delete and correct personal information, and the right not to be treated differently for using these rights. We do not sell or “share” personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising, so there is nothing to opt out of.</p>

    <h2>How we protect it</h2>
    <p>This site uses HTTPS, and only the people who need your information to help you can open it. No method of sending information online is perfectly secure, so please do not send medical or financial details through the website form.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top. We will post any important change here before it takes effect.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about your privacy? {site.emailLive ? <>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></> : <>Call or text <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></>}.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
